The algorithms implemented here come from published work and their reference code:
Dense Inverse Search optical flow (Till Kroeger et al., OF_DIS; OpenCV DISOpticalFlow) and
Farneback's polynomial-expansion optical flow (OpenCV optflowgf.cpp). OpenCV is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/blob/4.x/LICENSE
